sentences.t:
Venídom es deliçio de tierras d'allent mar,
entraré en las armas, non lo podré dexar;
mis fijas e mi mugier ve[e]rme an lidiar;

sentences.l:
Come-to-me is delight from lands of-beyond sea,
I-will-enter into the arms, not it I-will-be-able to-leave;
my daughters and my wife see[e]-me will fight;

sentences.t:
con la merced de Dios e de santa María madre,
créçem el coraçón por que estades delant;
con Dios aquesta lid yo la he de arrancar.”

sentences.l:
with the mercy of God and of holy Mary mother,
grows-me the heart because you-are before;
with God this battle I it have to win.”
